  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: 'You learned the healing arts of your community wielding your ceremonial
    chonta, a tool you carved yourself and imbued with sacred oils and herbs. This
    process opened your eyes to ailments of a more mystical nature: malefic spirits,
    haunts, possession, and more. You likely took up adventuring to combat these
    horrors, or you may have fled an evil beyond your power to vanquish. Choose two
    attribute boosts. One must be to Constitution or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute
    boost. You''re trained in the Medicine skill and the Herbalism Lore skill. You
    gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Inoculation] skill feat.'
